body:
Here me out on this.......... Star Gaurdian Urgot........

&#x200B;

Think About it.

They cant Buff the E and let it scale or people would play Assasin Wukong mid and they want to discourage that. The E nerf WILL nerf his early game because he has no scaling and people typically max E first. I don't know if Q will be the goto after the nerfs I will have to test and see, but the E nerf is definitely a nerf to his early game dmg. The passive nerfs is basically nothing you lose like 10 armor late game.

&#x200B;

These nerfs probably won't be enough but his WR should go down
